WEBVTT

00:14:59.746 --> 00:15:02.412
the more she started to reframe
the disturbance as

00:15:02.412 --> 00:15:06.162
an opportunity to take off in
an entirely new direction.

00:15:06.537 --> 00:15:10.537
This whole covid mess and the wreck that

00:15:10.537 --> 00:15:14.829
the airline industry has become right now
for me was an unexpected opportunity.

00:15:14.871 --> 00:15:18.496
So I'm back in school. I'm getting
a master's in psychology with

00:15:18.496 --> 00:15:21.037
an emphasis on coaching young adults

00:15:21.037 --> 00:15:23.704
and help them successfully
transition to adulthood.

00:15:24.287 --> 00:15:25.704
And it's just something I wanted to.

00:15:25.746 --> 00:15:29.579
I've been interested in for a while
and mentoring kind of program,